   "sec": 0,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **SDR 2026 – India's strengths:** India did best on **SDG 7** (clean energy) and **SDG 9** (industry and infrastructure); **SDG 2** (Zero Hunger) is still its biggest challenge."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 84,
   "sec": 4,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **6th Economic Census – size:** about **5.85 crore** establishments, **59.48%** of them in rural areas."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 84,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Learning with earning:** the skilling report wants apprenticeships as a mainstream pathway so young people keep learning while earning; it also proposes Skill Passports (Digital Lifelong Learning Accounts)."
  }
